{"code":"022220","name":"티케이지애강","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건축제품","sector_desc":"창호·바닥재·설비 등 건축용 제품. 주택 착공·리모델링 경기를 따릅니다.","desc":"동사는 1990년 설립된 태광그룹 계열의 배관재 및 소방기계설비 전문 기업으로, 2006년 코스닥시장에 재상장함. 배관재 부문에서는 PB(급수·난방용) 및 CPVC(소방용) 배관재를 제조·판매하며, 공동주택 및 건설현장의 급수·난방·소방 배관 시스템에 핵심 자재를 공급하고 있음. 소방기계설비 부문에서는 스프링클러 헤드 및 유수제어밸브 등을 제조·판매하며, 공동주택, 오피스텔, 공장 등에 설치되는 필수 설비를 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":805.0,"open":801.0,"high":814.0,"low":801.0,"volume":1601,"amount":1288805.0,"ret_1d":-1.9488,"gap":-2.4361,"range_pct":1.6149,"ret_5":-1.9488,"ret_20":-10.0559,"ret_60":46.8978,"ret_120":-10.0559,"ret_250":-0.4944,"ma20":824.55,"ma60":738.5333,"ma120":726.275,"ma200":708.385,"close_vs_ma200":13.6388,"close_vs_ma60":8.9998,"ma_align":1,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":679.9645,"r2_60":0.6225,"slope_120":7.2581,"r2_120":0.0031,"slope_250":0.4557,"r2_250":0.0001,"high52":975.0,"low52":500.0,"pos_52w":64.2105,"dd_52w":-17.4359,"mdd_1y":-43.0168,"atr14_pct":4.6584,"vol_ann_60":83.4677,"vol_avg20":15969.15,"vol_ratio20":0.1003,"vr5":0.1395,"vr20":0.0644,"amount_avg5":15392131.6,"amount_avg20":13163288.05,"amount_avg60":113620092.6167,"obv_chg20":13.3451,"turnover_20":0.6166,"pv_eff_20":-16.3077,"rsi14":47.7888,"frgn_net_5":6847.0,"inst_net_5":19400.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0132,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0375,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0507,"frgn_net_20":-37926.0,"inst_net_20":19400.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0732,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0375,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0358,"frgn_net_60":-27367.0,"inst_net_60":143275.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0528,"inst_net_60_pct":0.2766,"smart_net_60_pct":0.2238,"frgn_net_120":-455.0,"inst_net_120":509149.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0009,"inst_net_120_pct":0.983,"smart_net_120_pct":0.9821,"foreign_ratio":0.83,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.31,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":-29.0,"op_margin_q":-13.4259,"op_qoq":9.375,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-38.0952,"rev_yoy":12.5,"op_trend_4q":0.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-14.8,"debt_ratio":77.21,"per":null,"pbr":0.51,